    S_CONFIG --> S_STAGE[Stage as needs_action]
    S_STAGE --> S_TB[Trip Bucket Drawer]

    S_RESULTS --> S_NO_RESULTS[No Results State]
    S_TB --> S_REVIEW_CTA[Review Trip CTA]
    S_REVIEW_CTA --> S_REVIEW[Trip Review<br/>/trip/review]